      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/STAGING/claude-4z5o-cross-instance-figure-urls/cat-harness.jsonld#process/Process_KgToPortal",
      "@type": "https://litlfred.github.io/bootstrap/0.1.0/ns#Process",
      "name": "KG to public portal",
      "summary": "How a knowledge graph reaches a public portal this repository does not run: select, serialize, package, sign, distribute, and verify on the portal's side.",
      "description": "How a knowledge graph reaches a public portal this repository does not run: select, serialize, package, sign, distribute, and verify on the portal's side. folio-assistant — KG to public portal.\n\nSix stages: select, serialize, package, sign, distribute, verify. Three\ndecisions belong to the DEPLOYMENT and are drawn as gateways rather than\nas steps — the ingestion transport, the versioned store, and the signing\nscheme. A pipeline that picks one of those is asserting a decision nobody\nmade.\n\nA CDN is a LAYER, not a publication host. PUBLICATION_HOSTS answers \"what\nserves the rendering\"; a cache answers \"what stands between the server and\nthe reader\", and the canonical URL stays the origin's either way.",
      "enforcement": "advisory",
      "sourcePath": "processes/kg/kg-to-portal.bpmn",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/litlfred/folio-assistant/blob/main/cat-harness/processes/kg/kg-to-portal.bpmn",
