    {
      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/STAGING/claude-4z5o-cross-instance-figure-urls/cat-harness.jsonld#process/Process_CopyOutMaterialized",
      "@type": "https://litlfred.github.io/bootstrap/0.1.0/ns#Process",
      "name": "Copy out materialized content — to work on somebody else's bytes",
      "summary": "Somebody wants to change content this repository holds a read-only materialized copy of: copy it into their own `folio/`, recording which original it came out of.",
      "description": "Somebody wants to change content this repository holds a read-only materialized copy of: copy it into their own `folio/`, recording which original it came out of. Materialized content is read-only. The owner, 2026-09-21: \"if we have a materialized <stub>/<sub-graph>, the contents of it should be immutable ... you would need to copy/mateiralize it to your own folio/ in order to mess around with it.\" And 2026-09-22, choosing between advising and enforcing: enforce from the start.\n\nSTRICT, and the reason is narrow. Only one step here is a gate, and it is Gateway_Frozen: whether the target is read-only at all. Everything after it is mechanical. What makes the process strict is that skipping it does not fail loudly — an edit in place succeeds, and is only caught later by check:materialized-fixity hashing bytes against the digest their record carries. A process whose omission looks exactly like compliance is the vlhk shape, and advisory would not hold it.\n\nThe copy-out re-opens NONE of the five materialisation gates. Those were answered when this repository decided it may hold these bytes at all (materialize-remote.bpmn); copying something already held is not a second acquisition. What the copy does inherit is the restrictions and copyright verdicts — the copy is a new artefact in the copier's folio, and publishing it is that folio's decision.\n\nThe three states, the five gates and the provenance pair are folio-assistant-core/schemas/materialization.ts. Nothing here restates them.",
      "enforcement": "strict",
      "sourcePath": "processes/library/copy-out-materialized.bpmn",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/litlfred/folio-assistant/blob/main/cat-harness/processes/library/copy-out-materialized.bpmn",
      "depiction": "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/STAGING/claude-4z5o-cross-instance-figure-urls/assets/img/workflows/copy-out-materialized.svg",
      "startNode": [
        "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/STAGING/claude-4z5o-cross-instance-figure-urls/cat-harness.jsonld#process/Process_CopyOutMaterialized/node/StartEvent_WantToEdit"
      ],
