            "description": "Per snippet, what will not compile. Run in the platform it reports `Files scanned: 0` and exits 1 — measured. That is a could-not-determine wearing a finding's exit code: this repository carries no folio, so there was nothing to scan. Read the scanned count before reading the verdict."
          }
        ]
      },
      "requirements": {
        "runtime": [
          "bun"
        ],
        "network": false
      },
      "satisfies": [
