      ],
      "validatorNotApplicable": "its nodes are `.bpmn` and `.dmn` — XML, counted 2026-09-24 as 77 and 9. A Zod schema parses JSON, so one here would be a category error; `check:workflows`, `xml-comment-check` and `check-process-documentation` grade them instead."
    },
