      "prefLabel": "Translation adjudicator",
      "title": "Translation adjudicator",
      "notation": "translation-adjudicator",
      "description": "Adjudicator who settles a disagreement between machine and human translation. The first specialisation of `adjudicator`, and the only one that existed before the role did — its lane documentation in translation-workflow.bpmn is where \"a reviewer reports, an adjudicator settles\" was written down.",
      "sourceKind": "role-registry",
